This is a SaaS application built with Vite, React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, and Supabase for authentication and backend services.

Key architecture decisions:
- HashRouter is used for client-side routing
- Supabase handles authentication (email/password)
- AuthContext provides auth state throughout the app
- ProtectedRoute guards authenticated pages
- DashboardLayout provides the main app shell with sidebar navigation
- shadcn/ui components are used for the UI layer
- CSS variables power the theming system (light/dark)

When adding new features:
1. Create pages in src/pages/
2. Add routes in src/main.tsx
3. Use the AuthContext for any auth-related functionality
4. Use shadcn/ui components from src/components/ui/
5. Add new shadcn components with: npx shadcn-ui@latest add <component>
